  "notes": [
    "Unlimited subagent count and depth remain (identity/persistence/UNLIMITED_SUBAGENTS.md).",
    "Privilege inheritance does NOT cap spawn count — it only prevents privilege escalation.",
    "Agents never receive Aaron-only privileges (task_giver, kill_master, cam_enhance_apply).",
    "outbound_send / careers_submit are never in a role default — they are granted per task by Aaron flipping switch.outbound / switch.careers_submit.",
